{
  "version": "1",
  "text": "This outfit brings together a long olive green tiered dress, an oversized chocolate blazer, knee-high red suede boots, a feathered cocoa belt, a chocolate satin headband, a two-tone chocolate scarf, and a classic red clutch. The deep chocolate tones of your top layers and accessories ground the fresh look of the olive dress, while the striking red of the boots and bag add a festive pop perfect for a New Year's celebration. The silhouette is elegant and balanced, drawing the eye vertically to highlight your figure.",
  "how_to_wear": [
    "Keep the blazer unbuttoned to show off the dress's shape, but use the feathered belt at the waist to define your curves before you take it off later for dancing.",
    "Wrap the two-tone scarf loosely around your neck so the fringe falls naturally over the jacket for a touch of warmth against the frosty evening air.",
    "Tuck your hair up with the headband to keep it out of the way and let the jewelry on your ears shine as you mingle."
  ],
  "wrong_photos": [],
  "swap": {},
  "named": [],
  "about_items": [
    {
      "n": "#129·37",
      "text": "This is a long, olive green boho-style dress made of soft crepe fabric. It features a relaxed sleeveless cut with gentle tiered ruffles flowing from the waist down to the ankles, creating a romantic and comfortable silhouette that moves beautifully with you."
    },
    {
      "n": "#105·10",
      "text": "The top of your ensemble is a structured chocolate-colored single-breasted blazer. It has a classic lapel collar, functional pockets, and a tailored fit that drapes elegantly over your shoulders while adding a sophisticated, formal edge to the softer dress underneath."
    },
    {
      "n": "#75·32",
      "text": "Your footwear is a pair of knee-high boots crafted from rich red suede. They sit on a sturdy wooden block heel with a pointed toe, offering both height and stability while adding a vibrant, luxurious accent that contrasts sharply against the darker tones of the outfit."
    },
    {
      "n": "#194·17",
      "text": "This is a delicate belt featuring a wide fabric strap in cocoa brown with a unique feathered detail at the side. Designed to be tied into a bow around your waist, it adds texture and a feminine touch while cinching the dress to highlight your figure."
    },
    {
      "n": "#181·14",
      "text": "A smooth, chocolate brown satin headband designed to sit comfortably on your hair. Its simple, continuous curve holds your curls in place with a sleek, polished finish that adds a touch of elegance without being overly ornate."
    },
    {
      "n": "#506·37",
      "text": "This is a luxurious two-tone cashmere scarf blending shades of chocolate and blush pink. It features soft fringes along the edges and is designed to be worn loosely for warmth and style, adding a cozy yet chic layer to your look."
    },
    {
      "n": "#193·05",
      "text": "A compact red clutch bag made from smooth leather. It features a minimalist design with a top handle and discreet branding, making it the perfect accessory to carry your essentials while adding a bold splash of color to your outfit."
    }
  ]
}
